<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81699" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί-μετρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτρον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>very large</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, only in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>, as epith. of Penelope's web, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστὸν
				. . ὕφαινε λεπτὸν καὶ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				2.95
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				19.140
			</span></i>; later, of bulk, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δέμας,
			κήτεα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.190
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.47
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>well fitting</i>, of a garment, <i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				1.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετρος</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραμμή</span>), ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίμετρον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				838b21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.12.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLille</u>
				1.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.56.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.5.4
			</span></i>.</div>
